    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1940870/extras/2f83049ab54dabd8a0e6c33e952c81db.poster.avif?t=1754648337\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1940870/extras/2f83049ab54dabd8a0e6c33e952c81db.webm?t=1754648337\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1940870/extras/2f83049ab54dabd8a0e6c33e952c81db.mp4?t=1754648337\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>The Creator: Immerse Yourself in the World of Design</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Creator is a simulation game where you become a design master, creating stylish and cozy spaces in the most picturesque corners of the world. No limits, no stress \u2014 just creativity and inspiration!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1940870/extras/8f3212c714c17512750bcab72799fd00.poster.avif?t=1754648337\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1940870/extras/8f3212c714c17512750bcab72799fd00.webm?t=1754648337\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1940870/extras/8f3212c714c17512750bcab72799fd00.mp4?t=1754648337\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Design Master</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use a variety of decor elements, furniture, plants, and landscape features to create unique interior and exterior designs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose styles, colors, and materials to your liking, filling locations with an atmosphere of comfort and harmony.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1940870/extras/a04e0547afd7b9c35a2fc55cc3ee41d2.poster.avif?t=1754648337\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1940870/extras/a04e0547afd7b9c35a2fc55cc3ee41d2.webm?t=1754648337\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1940870/extras/a04e0547afd7b9c35a2fc55cc3ee41d2.mp4?t=1754648337\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Location Variety</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize cozy city apartments and residential homes of all kinds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Garages and various rooms offer space for your unique ideas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enhance the setting with comfortable rest areas and functional elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Thousands of items await to be part of your design projects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1940870/extras/62db8556cc59ec13c4afe8eebb5b3d79.poster.avif?t=1754648337\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1940870/extras/62db8556cc59ec13c4afe8eebb5b3d79.webm?t=1754648337\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1940870/extras/62db8556cc59ec13c4afe8eebb5b3d79.mp4?t=1754648337\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Creativity and Immersion</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Forget about resource hunting and constraints \u2014 focus entirely on beauty creation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experiment freely, enjoying the process and finding perfect solutions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1940870/extras/2183c918cee3a3630d6f8ec81fd4ecfb.poster.avif?t=1754648337\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1940870/extras/2183c918cee3a3630d6f8ec81fd4ecfb.webm?t=1754648337\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1940870/extras/2183c918cee3a3630d6f8ec81fd4ecfb.mp4?t=1754648337\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Realistic day-night cycles and diverse weather conditions \u2014 from sunny days to thunderstorms with lightning \u2014 add depth and expressiveness to your creations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1940870/extras/52acd0ea946a1aa47d419f03b04c26b3.poster.avif?t=1754648337\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1940870/extras/52acd0ea946a1aa47d419f03b04c26b3.webm?t=1754648337\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1940870/extras/52acd0ea946a1aa47d419f03b04c26b3.mp4?t=1754648337\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Capture stunning photos of your projects with a customizable photo mode featuring various filters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Share your best shots with friends and the gaming community, drawing inspiration from others\u2019 work.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1940870/extras/2f83049ab54dabd8a0e6c33e952c81db.poster.avif?t=1754648337\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1940870/extras/2f83049ab54dabd8a0e6c33e952c81db.webm?t=1754648337\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1940870/extras/2f83049ab54dabd8a0e6c33e952c81db.mp4?t=1754648337\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>The Creator: Immerse Yourself in the World of Design</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Creator is a simulation game where you become a design master, creating stylish and cozy spaces in the most picturesque corners of the world. No limits, no stress \u2014 just creativity and inspiration!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1940870/extras/8f3212c714c17512750bcab72799fd00.poster.avif?t=1754648337\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1940870/extras/8f3212c714c17512750bcab72799fd00.webm?t=1754648337\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1940870/extras/8f3212c714c17512750bcab72799fd00.mp4?t=1754648337\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Design Master</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use a variety of decor elements, furniture, plants, and landscape features to create unique interior and exterior designs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose styles, colors, and materials to your liking, filling locations with an atmosphere of comfort and harmony.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1940870/extras/a04e0547afd7b9c35a2fc55cc3ee41d2.poster.avif?t=1754648337\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1940870/extras/a04e0547afd7b9c35a2fc55cc3ee41d2.webm?t=1754648337\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1940870/extras/a04e0547afd7b9c35a2fc55cc3ee41d2.mp4?t=1754648337\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Location Variety</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize cozy city apartments and residential homes of all kinds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Garages and various rooms offer space for your unique ideas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enhance the setting with comfortable rest areas and functional elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Thousands of items await to be part of your design projects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1940870/extras/62db8556cc59ec13c4afe8eebb5b3d79.poster.avif?t=1754648337\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1940870/extras/62db8556cc59ec13c4afe8eebb5b3d79.webm?t=1754648337\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1940870/extras/62db8556cc59ec13c4afe8eebb5b3d79.mp4?t=1754648337\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Creativity and Immersion</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Forget about resource hunting and constraints \u2014 focus entirely on beauty creation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experiment freely, enjoying the process and finding perfect solutions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1940870/extras/2183c918cee3a3630d6f8ec81fd4ecfb.poster.avif?t=1754648337\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1940870/extras/2183c918cee3a3630d6f8ec81fd4ecfb.webm?t=1754648337\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1940870/extras/2183c918cee3a3630d6f8ec81fd4ecfb.mp4?t=1754648337\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Realistic day-night cycles and diverse weather conditions \u2014 from sunny days to thunderstorms with lightning \u2014 add depth and expressiveness to your creations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1940870/extras/52acd0ea946a1aa47d419f03b04c26b3.poster.avif?t=1754648337\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1940870/extras/52acd0ea946a1aa47d419f03b04c26b3.webm?t=1754648337\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1940870/extras/52acd0ea946a1aa47d419f03b04c26b3.mp4?t=1754648337\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Capture stunning photos of your projects with a customizable photo mode featuring various filters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Share your best shots with friends and the gaming community, drawing inspiration from others\u2019 work.</p>",
    "short_description": "The Creator is a peaceful meditative game-simulator where you create unique designs for locations and territories. Enjoy the creative process without searching for resources or fear of making mistakes, as you design stunning interiors and exteriors in picturesque corners of the world.",
